    "summary": "An empty Venom can use Aerialists when fighting ends in the Fight phase. Choose one friendly DRUKHARI INFANTRY unit, up to six models, all 6″ away or closer. Units able to FLY qualify only while in Engagement Range of an enemy. The selection may board even if it left a TRANSPORT earlier in the turn. The Venom has room for six DRUKHARI INFANTRY models and excludes JUMP PACK models. As the Declare Battle Formations step begins, you may split one of your units into two almost equal halves. This option covers WYCHES, HAND OF THE ARCHON and KABALITE WARRIORS. Record the models assigned to each half. Start one half aboard this Venom. The other may deploy on its own or begin aboard another TRANSPORT.",
